["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">馴れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习惯；适应；熟悉；熟练；有经验；驯服；驯化；习惯于做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184275\"><ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することになれていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当学生时,我不得不学习。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绳子；绳索；绳带；警绳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180474\"><ruby>強盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>うし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろ<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>縄<rp>(</rp><rt>なわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>縛<rp>(</rp><rt>しば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盗贼把我绑在后手。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；那个东西；你懂的；那玩意儿；那什么东西；那谁；阴茎；那话儿；（一点也）不；（毫）不；什么？；嗯？；喂！；搞什么！；什么嘛（表示恼怒）；没事；没关系；哪里</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236417\">「ユリ」を<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">“朱莉”在英语中是什么意思?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">南</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">南风牌；南风刻子和牌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">難</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">困难；麻烦；艰苦；缺乏；事故；灾难；危险；缺点；缺陷；瑕疵；批评；指责；非难</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113158\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのなぞなぞを<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なく<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他轻易地解决了这个问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なんか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">诸如……之类的；像……这样的；……之流</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221811\">この<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してやさしくなんかないんだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个工作永远不会轻松。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">南極</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">南极；南极地区；南极洲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145181\"><ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>南極<rp>(</rp><rt>なんきょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのを<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在报纸上,我知道他从南极洲回来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ナンセンス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒唐；荒谬；无稽之谈；品味低劣；不时尚；俗气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204311\">そんなナンセンスなことはやめてくれよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要再做这么愚蠢的事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何だか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんだか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">有点；有些；不知为何</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118273\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のねらいが<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だかわかってきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我知道他的屁股是什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なんだかんだ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">这样那样；七七八八；什么什么的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何て</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">多么…！；真是…！；什么？；什么意思？</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90932\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ておしゃべりなんだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她怎么会说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何で</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんで</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">为什么；为了什么；怎样；用什么方法；如何</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187813\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそんなことをしたのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么她要做这种事情呢？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8734997\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何でも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんでも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">任何；什么；随便；一切；据说；听说；我听说</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222102\">この<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもほとんど<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这只狗几乎吃了什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何と</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；怎样；多么……！；真是……！；竟然；令人惊讶的是；出乎意料地；哎呀；哇；嗯；那么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189231\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でこの<ruby>昆虫<rp>(</rp><rt>こんちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个昆虫在英语中是什么意思?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何とか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんとか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某种东西；某物；某某；想办法；设法；总算；好歹</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182483\"><ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>いそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げば<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とか<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果你匆忙,我会及时到达。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なんとなく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">莫名其妙；不知为何；不知怎的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187763\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となくはわかりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我以某种方式明白了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なんとも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">非常；很；极其；极为；（不）什么；（一）点也不；毫不</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187759\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とも<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いようがないなあ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没办法说什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何なり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんなり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">任何；随便什么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ナンバー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数字；号码；车牌；号码牌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">南米</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんべい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">南美</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155561\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>清水<rp>(</rp><rt>きよみず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>舞台<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>飛<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りる<ruby>気持<rp>(</rp><rt>きも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちで<ruby>南米<rp>(</rp><rt>なんべい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想从清水舞台上跳下来,去南美。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">南北</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なんぼく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">南北；南方与北方；朝鲜半岛南北；韩国与朝鲜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">二</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">に</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">二；2</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">荷</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">に</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">货物；行李；货运；商品；负担；责任</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142313\"><ruby>石油<rp>(</rp><rt>せきゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>港<rp>(</rp><rt>みなと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>荷<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしされる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">石油将在东京港下载。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">似合う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にあう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">适合；相配；相称</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231285\">あのドレスは<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によく<ruby>似合<rp>(</rp><rt>にあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那条连衣裙真的很适合她。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/408236\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">煮える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被煮熟；被烹熟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215043\">スープがなべでぐつぐつ<ruby>煮<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤就煮熟了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">におい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气味；臭味；香气；气息；迹象；风味；氛围；日本刀刃纹上沿淬火线的淡雾状纹理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231152\">あの<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はにおいが<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那朵花的气味很强。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">匂う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">におう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span cla