=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逃がす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にがす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">释放；放走；让……逃脱；错过；遗漏；失去；未能抓住</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217446\">こんなにすばらしい<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>逃<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしてはいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要错过如此伟大的机会。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にがて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不擅长；薄弱；不太擅长；不合胃口；不是所好</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155611\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>数学<rp>(</rp><rt>すうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>苦手<rp>(</rp><rt>にがて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不喜欢数学。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">にきび</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">痘痘；粉刺；青春痘</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198796\">ニキビが<ruby>治<rp>(</rp><rt>なお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">麻疹不治愈。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賑やか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にぎやか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span cl